# Keep the build context lean and keep env files out of the image. No env file
# with real values ever enters the context: the build-time env is handed to
# `docker build` as a BuildKit secret (see docker/prod/Dockerfile) and only the
# committed .env.dist templates are let through. deploy/ is where CI checks out
# the private deploy repo — never part of the context either.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.dist
deploy
